                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58bbeadd-3baa-43fd-a8cd-d0ba716d0239",
                                "sense_id": "14c73e42-7fb8-3183-b7f2-875bd2aa560c",
                                "text": "Если всё прошлое и настоящее детерминировано, а будущее предетерминировано, то свобода есть субъективное психологическое состояние, вполне иллюзорное, только всего."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e34f70a6-a68a-40f8-b654-6c3dabb91803",
                                "sense_id": "14c73e42-7fb8-3183-b7f2-875bd2aa560c",
                                "text": "Большая часть политической и общественной жизни современного человечества не есть реальная онтологическая жизнь, это фиктивная, иллюзорная жизнь."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66845dff-2d9c-45d2-8ec4-c15f98c00ed9",
                                "sense_id": "14c73e42-7fb8-3183-b7f2-875bd2aa560c",
                                "text": "Содержание иллюзорных восприятий обыкновенно легко меняется и не является стойким, но вообще наклонность к такого рода восприятиям, поскольку она обусловлена моментами, стоящими в связи с существом болезни, может в течение определенного периода держаться очень прочно."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "acba9123-fe97-4cfc-a926-09d71582b6cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "ad68cbb5-bd0e-3117-87bb-f61192f40f20",
                        "source_sense_id": "14c73e42-7fb8-3183-b7f2-875bd2aa560c",
                        "target_lang_word": "illusive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "illusive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4e0a574-0282-3e21-8f3b-6db601d45810",
                                        "entry_id": "74bad33e-0fc5-31a6-9e12-04d5452dfdb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Subject to or pertaining to an illusion, often used in the sense of an unrealistic expectation or an unreachable goal or outcome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93f7fcc1-6a3b-48c9-9b35-14693bb1561b",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e0a574-0282-3e21-8f3b-6db601d45810",
                                                "text": "Testing software completely is an illusive goal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92212c3b-9f5e-46fb-85cc-2fbbf0602d6b",
                                                "sense_id": "d4e0a574-0282-3e21-8f3b-6db601d45810",
                                                "text": "[…] he could not catch the illusive thing that had sadly perplexed as well as elevated his spirit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57ad0266-89e8-421a-8277-4c5609b26d7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ad68cbb5-bd0e-3117-87bb-f61192f40f20",
                        "source_sense_id": "14c73e42-7fb8-3183-b7f2-875bd2aa560c",
                        "target_lang_word": "illusory",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "illusory",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7a67c25-fa7a-3741-aa46-40c04851bffb",
                                        "entry_id": "f79d9737-215d-3569-a72c-e2c221f0f11e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resulting from an illusion; deceptive, imaginary, unreal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4aaed50-1c09-45c3-80d2-2ae016b982e8",
                                                "sense_id": "c7a67c25-fa7a-3741-aa46-40c04851bffb",
                                                "text": "The invalidity of a cognition is the otherwiseness of its object, and is known by a sublating cognition. The illusory cognition of silver knows illusory silver, but does not know its otherwiseness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e1fc676-f5ac-4ae2-8c5f-07a3a3d8eb2b",
                                                "sense_id": "c7a67c25-fa7a-3741-aa46-40c04851bffb",
                                                "text": "Yet for this new womanosphere, the response is not advancing policies like paid family leave or affordable childcare, but to return to an idealized, illusory past where being a wife and mother was viewed as a woman’s sole purpose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
